messages.content:
Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: python/libxml.c
Line: 1218
Function: pythonAttributeDecl
Bug type: use-after-free
CWE: CWE-416
Explanation: PyList_SetItem steals a reference to newName, but the code then calls Py_DECREF(newName). This decrements the refcount twice, freeing the object while the list still holds it, leading to use-after-free when the list is used.

